  "clipIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "publish": true
}
```

### Batch Add Tags
```
POST /api/clips/batch/add-tags
```

**Body**:
```json
{
  "clipIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"]
}
```

### Batch Delete
```
POST /api/clips/batch/delete
```

**Body**:
```json
{
  "clipIds": [1, 2, 3]
}
```

