  "tag": "headshot",
  "patterns": ["headshot", "ace"],
  "category": "Gameplay"
}
```

**Response**: Created pattern object

### Update Tag Pattern
```
PATCH /api/tag-patterns/:tag
```

**Body**: Same as create

**Response**: Updated pattern object

### Delete Tag Pattern
```
DELETE /api/tag-patterns/:tag
```

**Response**: `{ "ok": true }`

