**Body**: Raw video file data

**Response**:
```json
{
  "url": "http://publisher-domain.com/filename.mp4"
}
```

### Unpublish Clip
```
DELETE /api/publish/:filename
```

**Response**: `{ "ok": true }`

### List Published Clips
```
GET /api/publish
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "files": ["clip1.mp4", "clip2.mp4"]
}
```

### Purge Cloudflare Cache
```
POST /api/publish/purge-cache
```

**Body**:
```json
{
  "urls": ["http://domain.com/file.mp4"]
}
```

**Response**: `{ "ok": true }`

**Note**: Requires Cloudflare API credentials in environment variables

